{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Meeting of Gas Station, Convenience Store, and Horror</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through the game by performing ordinary night-shift tasks yourself.<br>What begins as simple, familiar routine gradually twists into anxiety and terror as time passes.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throw away expired products</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stock new items on the shelves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mop the floor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run the register</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Refuel customers\u2019 vehicles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clean the restroom</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998790/extras/bbbffd8599ea6a99f1717bdf8e1ce5d1.poster.avif?t=1773936266\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998790/extras/bbbffd8599ea6a99f1717bdf8e1ce5d1.webm?t=1773936266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998790/extras/bbbffd8599ea6a99f1717bdf8e1ce5d1.mp4?t=1773936266\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Three-Day Record of Commuting Between Home and Work</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start the day, satisfy your hunger, do the chores, head to work, come home, and fall asleep.<br>Within this endless cycle, the cracks in reality slowly begin to show.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eat meals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do the laundry</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a shower</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tidy up the house</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endure the nightmares that come every night</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998790/extras/9d8151d71daec07491ffb693728668b8.poster.avif?t=1773936266\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998790/extras/9d8151d71daec07491ffb693728668b8.webm?t=1773936266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998790/extras/9d8151d71daec07491ffb693728668b8.mp4?t=1773936266\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Reality That Slowly Falls Apart</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It starts with small, barely noticeable feelings of unease.<br>But as time goes on, the spaces around you become grotesquely distorted, and hallucinations and fear begin to close in on the player.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious presence watching from beyond the window</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strange figures slipping between the shelves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A store stained in blood</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sudden chase sequences</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Horror events occurring throughout the house</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A psychological collapse where nightmares and reality become one</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998790/extras/4963ae7f7d55b3788be7c295edd814ec.poster.avif?t=1773936266\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998790/extras/4963ae7f7d55b3788be7c295edd814ec.webm?t=1773936266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998790/extras/4963ae7f7d55b3788be7c295edd814ec.mp4?t=1773936266\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gather Clues and Uncover the Truth</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clues hinting at the truth behind the incident are hidden throughout the protagonist\u2019s home and workplace.<br>The more traces you uncover\u2014photographs, diaries, documents, pill bottles\u2014the more the story you believed in begins to unravel.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Three Multiple Endings</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ending changes depending on your choices and the clues you collect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What you accept, what you deny,<br>and ultimately what you choose in the end\u2014<br>that is up to you.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3998790?t=1773936266","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998790/89e46e89a5f01243367cdd46623bda61f33c8d8d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773936266","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998790/eaa50b11c8e4c56fb8cd5d2909aed57d1b66dd1d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773936266","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998790/eaa50b11c8e4c56fb8cd5d2909aed57d1b66dd1d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773936266","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4045090,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Meeting of Gas Station, Convenience Store, and Horror</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through the game by performing ordinary night-shift tasks yourself.<br>What begins as simple, familiar routine gradu