rkplace.<br>The more traces you uncover\u2014photographs, diaries, documents, pill bottles\u2014the more the story you believed in begins to unravel.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Three Multiple Endings</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ending changes depending on your choices and the clues you collect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What you accept, what you deny,<br>and ultimately what you choose in the end\u2014<br>that is up to you.</p>","developers":["Playnova Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998790/231429f45e9511324cd000a7ad5485b54d8014b4/header.jpg?t=1773936266","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3998790/165515731/4a9384dc8f01da5e738e4f31b8a279220d823ed1/1772572997/dash_av1.mpd?t=1773882654","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3998790/165515731/4a9384dc8f01da5e738e4f31b8a279220d823ed1/1772572997/dash_h264.mpd?t=1773882654","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3998790/165515731/4a9384dc8f01da5e738e4f31b8a279220d823ed1/1772572997/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1773882654","id":257297403,"name":"Official Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257297403/f1668e58ee909ae78fa6b852adb01ad331afe509/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1773882654"}],"name":"Empty Gauge","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-3570 / AMD Ryzen 3 1200 or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 750 Ti / GTX 960 or AMD R7 370 / RX 460, 2 GB VRAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX